Restoration should not be evaluated using one universal ecological metric.

## Forests

Potential indicators include:

* vegetation structure;
* species composition;
* age-class distribution;
* fuel conditions;
* fire behavior;
* watershed response;
* wildlife habitat;
* regeneration;
* resilience;
* long-term forest condition.

