Potential indicators include:

* native plant composition;
* invasive species;
* structural diversity;
* soil condition;
* pollinator abundance;
* wildlife response;
* fire regime;
* grazing effects.

## Rivers and Streams

Potential indicators include:

* flow regime;
* temperature;
* sediment;
* channel structure;
* connectivity;
* fish passage;
* macroinvertebrates;
* native fish abundance;
* recruitment.

## Wetlands

Potential indicators include:

* hydrology;
* vegetation;
* water quality;
* soil condition;
* wildlife use;
