## Coastal Systems

Potential indicators include:

* wetland extent;
* elevation;
* tidal exchange;
* vegetation;
* sediment dynamics;
* fish and wildlife use;
* shoreline stability;
* reef condition;
* nursery function.

The appropriate measure depends on the ecological objective.

